{
  "name": "Alert sales in Slack when target companies post relevant jobs with LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hiring signals to Slack\n\n### How it works\n1. Every weekday morning, Job Search finds new postings that signal a need for your product.\n2. Companies already alerted in earlier runs are skipped.\n3. Find Role identifies the likely buyer at each company, and Email Finder gets their work email.\n4. A Slack message gives the rep the signal, the buyer, and the email.\n\n### Setup\n1. Set titles and countries in **Search new jobs**.\n2. Set the buyer title in **Find the buyer**.\n3. Pick a Slack channel in **Alert sales**.\n4. Select your LeadMagic and Slack credentials.\n\n### Customization\nJob Search charges per job returned, so keep the limit near your daily volume. Swap Slack for HubSpot or a sheet to log signals instead.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "41f77bae-a73c-5d93-973d-014e36824262",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "186d30c4-9e69-5f14-a8f4-dcb4ece07cfa",
      "name": "Weekdays at 8am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "job",
        "operation": "searchJobs",
        "titlesInclude": "Revenue Operations, Sales Operations",
        "jobFilters": {
          "countries": "US",
          "postedWithin": 1
        },
        "limit": 25
      },
      "id": "4afd3cb5-885c-5afa-bc51-ef84fd7752f5",
      "name": "Search new jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0",
              "name": "job_title",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "company_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.company?.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "company_domain",
              "value": "={{ ($json.company?.website_url ?? '').replace(/^https?:\\/\\/(www\\.)?/, '').split('/')[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3ad423e1-4ea9-5760-939b-8cc46234185b",
      "name": "Company domain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.company_domain }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "de925aa1-8852-5a5c-8670-ce624e1bc28e",
      "name": "New companies only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "people",
        "operation": "findRole",
        "job_title": "VP of Sales",
        "searchMethod": "domain",
        "company_domain": "={{ $json.company_domain }}"
      },
      "id": "f32f8e29-5080-5cf8-ae26-c78ec125c153",
      "name": "Find the buyer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.profile_url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4941fe6b-80eb-570f-a589-8a8442ab6796",
      "name": "Buyer found",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "findEmail",
        "findBy": "profile",
        "profile_url": "={{ $json.profile_url }}"
      },
      "id": "b6d03eca-cb01-5511-a5b1-a7c310f43f8b",
      "name": "Find buyer email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "text": "=:mag: *{{ $('Company domain').item.json.company_name }}* is hiring a *{{ $('Company domain').item.json.job_title }}*.\nBuyer: {{ $('Find the buyer').item.json.name }} ({{ $('Find the buyer').item.json.profile_url }})\nEmail: {{ $json.email || 'not found' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "5ff37eb3-8524-5aa2-9723-a40c3b0c2153",
      "name": "Alert sales",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1540,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Only new companies\n**New companies only** remembers domains across runs, so each company alerts once.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "002c833f-4951-5f74-bcce-643b4ced73c0",
      "name": "Dedupe note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -180
      ]
    }
  ],
